cases.semanticExcerpt:
The '''gem pouch''' is a [[Gem containers|gem container]] created with level 12 [[Crafting]] by combining a [[bolt of linen]] with [[silk]] using a [[needle]] and [[thread]]. It can hold 5 of each (15 total) '''uncut''' [[gems]] of the following types:
{{List|c=1|
* {{plink|Uncut opal}}
* {{plink|Uncut jade}}
* {{plink|Uncut red topaz}}
}}
A full gem pouch is worth {{Coins|5*({{GEP|Uncut opal}} + {{GEP|Uncut jade}} + {{GEP|Uncut red topaz}})}}. At level 39 [[Crafting]], players can upgrade the pouch to a [[gem satchel]], which holds up to 10 of the aforementioned gems.

